---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use" description={`Terms of Use for ${site.siteUrl}.`}>
  <Navbar />
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 py-14 prose prose-stone">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-[var(--navy)] not-prose mb-2">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-stone-500 not-prose mb-10">Last updated: July 25, 2026 · {site.siteUrl}</p>

    <p>
      By using {site.siteUrl}, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the site.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Site operated by {site.name}, {site.title}, DRE# {site.dre}, {site.brokerage}.
      Real estate services are offered where properly licensed.
    </p>

    <h2>Informational purpose</h2>
    <p>
      Content is for general information only and is not legal, tax, or financial advice. Market conditions change.
      Property information, if any, is deemed reliable but not guaranteed. Always verify critical details independently.
    </p>

    <h2>No guarantee of results</h2>
    <p>
      Past performance and general market commentary do not guarantee future results in any transaction.
    </p>

    <h2>Not a solicitation of listed property</h2>
    <p>
      This website is not intended as a solicitation of property currently listed with another broker.
    </p>

    <h2>Lead forms</h2>
    <p>
      Submitting a form requests contact about real estate services. It does not create an agency relationship until
      a written agreement is signed where required.
    </p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Site design and original content are owned by us or used under license. Do not copy for commercial reuse without permission.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, WE ARE NOT LIABLE FOR INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES
      ARISING FROM USE OF THE SITE. TOTAL LIABILITY FOR CLAIMS RELATING TO THE SITE IS LIMITED TO USD $100.
    </p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of California.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> ·
      <a href="/contact">Contact</a> ·
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
